Description: FortiOS command-line interface
 forti discovers, reads, plans and applies FortiGate configuration over the
 FortiOS REST API (v2). Every resource of FortiOS 7.4.8 is addressable, with
 field validation from the SDK's typed models.
 .
 Changes are planned first: a plan validates the operations, shows the field
 diff and is applied only after a human approved it at an interactive
 terminal. Profiles are read-only unless writes are enabled, and credentials
 come from a credential store, never from the command line.
 .
 Built on forti-api (libforti-api-dev), the header-only FortiOS SDK.
